{
  "Scenes.Ember.DragonFarce.BalanceLost": " Your head swims--it'll take a moment before you can regain your balance."
  "Scenes.Ember.DragonFarce.BlastHits": "Try as you might, you can't seem to protect yourself; and the blast hits you like a stone, throwing you to the ground."
  "Scenes.Ember.DragonFarce.BlastJumped": "You quickly manage to jump out of the way and watch in awe as the blast gouges into the ground you were standing on mere moments ago."
  "Scenes.Ember.DragonFarce.DeafeningRoar": "Ember bares [Ember eir] teeth and releases a deafening roar; a concussive blast of force heads straight for you! "
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberAttack.BlindClawMiss": "{0}{1} completely misses you with a blind attack!"
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberAttack.ClawSlash": "With a growl, the {0}dragon lashes out in a ferocious splay-fingered slash, [Ember eir] claws poised to rip into your flesh. "
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberAttack.ClawsRip": "Ember's claws rip into you, leaving stinging wounds."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberAttack.ClawsScrapeArmor": "Ember's claws scrape noisily but harmlessly off your [armor]."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberAttack.ClawsWhistlePast": "You dodge aside at the last second and Ember's claws whistle past you."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberReactsToLustiness.EyesGlazedTease": "The dragon {0}, weaving softly from side to side, eyes glazed{1} at the intimate prospect of sex... but then, to your surprise, [Ember ey] visibly shakes it off and recomposes [Ember em]self, frowning at you."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberReactsToLustiness.FarFromVictory": "[pg]Despite Ember's initial display; you realize that, Ember was still a ways from [Ember eir] peak arousal. The dragon flies off in a huff, irritated that you would stoop to fighting in a such a manner."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberReactsToLustiness.HowBoring": " How boring."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberReactsToLustiness.NotOrdinaryMonster": "[pg][say: W-what do you think you're doing!? I'm not some ordinary monster! Don't think you can seduce me out of a battle!]"
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.BlindTailMiss": "{0}{1} completely misses you with a blind tail-slap!"
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.DuckUnder": "duck under"
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.LeapOver": "leap over"
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.TailDodged": " the tail at the last moment, causing Ember to lose control of [Ember eir] own momentum and stumble."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.TailSlams": " The tail slams into you with bone-cracking force, knocking you heavily to the ground even as the spines jab you wickedly. You gasp for breath in pain and shock, but manage to struggle to your feet again."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.TailSpin": "Ember suddenly spins on [Ember eir] heel, the long tail that splays behind [Ember em] lashing out like a whip. As it hurtles through the air towards you, your attention focuses on the set of spikes suddenly protruding from its tip!"
  "Scenes.Ember.EmberTailSlap.YouLead": " You "
  "Scenes.Ember.EmbersSupahSpecialDragonBreath.BlindedTracking": "The blinded dragon tracks you with difficulty as you sprint around the landscape; seeing an opportunity, you strafe around [Ember eir] side, planting yourself behind a large flat boulder near [Ember em] and pelting {0} with a small rock. The scream as the dragon turns the magical conflagration toward you, only to have it hit the rock and blow up in [Ember eir] face, is quite satisfying. "
  "Scenes.Ember.EmbersSupahSpecialDragonBreath.BreathBurns": " The pain as the deadly combination washes over you is indescribable. It's a miracle that you endure it, and even Ember looks amazed to see you still standing."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmbersSupahSpecialDragonBreath.BreathDodged": " It's a narrow thing, but you manage to throw yourself aside at the last moment. Fortunately, the energy whirling around and tearing up the soil blinds Ember to your escape until you have recovered and are ready to keep fighting."
  "Scenes.Ember.EmbersSupahSpecialDragonBreath.FireBreath": "Ember inhales deeply, then [Ember eir] jaws open up, releasing streams of fire, ice and lightning; magical rather than physical, the gaudy displays lose cohesion and amalgamate into a column of raw energy as they fly at you."
  "Scenes.Ember.RunCheck.FlappingHard": ", flapping as hard as you can"
  "Scenes.Ember.RunCheck.GivesChase": ", and Ember, caught up in the moment, gives chase. "
  "Scenes.Ember.RunCheck.RunningWord": " running"
  "Scenes.Ember.RunCheck.TakesOff": "You take off"
  "Scenes.Ember.RunFail.CaughtTackled": "Despite some impressive jinking, {0} catches you, tackling you to the ground.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Ember.RunSuccess.OutpacesDragon": "ou easily outpace the dragon, who begins hurling imprecations at you. [say: What the hell, [name], you weenie; are you so scared that you can't even stick out your punishment?]"
  "Scenes.Ember.RunSuccess.SkillLead": "Using your skill at running, y"
  "Scenes.Ember.RunSuccess.TauntsBack": "[pg]Not to be outdone, you call back, taunting her for her inability to catch you as she fumes in the distance."
  "Scenes.Ember.RunSuccess.YLetter": "Y"
}
